    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "画面碎了。\n苏念睁开眼，发现自己在流泪。\n不是她的泪——是画面里那个女孩的。但泪水从苏念的眼角滑下来，滴在吧台上。\n她低头看自己的手。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "左手无名指——外婆的烫伤疤痕——\n还在。\n但右手无名指——\n空的。\n苏念记得右手无名指上有一个戒指印——不是现在戴的，是很久以前戴过又摘下来的。外婆给她的银戒指"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian struggles to remember",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你还好吗？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "ring",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "消失了。\n她不记得那枚戒指是什么样子了。\n\"你还好吗？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
